      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree they should add a chat ping sound (option) So WE know to look above the player's head instead of their face when communicating.\nAlso add something what will let us know if a player can't see my chatbox, like if they can only see everyone's friend's chatbox or everyone's.\nAlso, add a filter option so we don't see the bad words?\n(also I think there shouldn't be a spam cooldown lol)\nOh, and adding text to speech sounds cool lol. \nMaybe add color fonts? Some people play with nametags off\nso maybe add an option to enable yellow color font for friends on the chatbox since it's still visible when nametags are turned off.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
