      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am trying to move my group over to VR chat. I also want new people to join. It is impossible to message people within the group. Therefore, people are joining, and I don’t know who they are, why they want to join my group, if they have read our rules. It states in my group profile that they need to join our Discord, but many don’t have it or ignore it. Even people in my own group are joining with different avatar names, and I have no idea who they are. I have run groups in many online worlds. It’s impossible to run a group where you can’t message the individual members. Please fix this. Also, the newest members should be listed at the top of the group members page so you don’t have to keep scrolling down to find them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
